<title>USA: Bonal International sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Bonal International sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHFIELD, Mich. 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bonal International Inc said its board of directors approved a two-for-one stock split effective February 1.</p>
<p>After the split, the company will have 1,656,000 shares outstanding, up from 828,000.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
